1
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,240
I received a black envelope last night.

2
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,730
We didn't return to reality at all.

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,800
This is still a system instance.

4
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,280
I got one too.

5
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,480
What does it say?

6
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,440
Keep an absolutely happy smile.

7
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:33,880
Listen,

8
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,440
the rule of this instance is that

9
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:37,280
no negative emotions are allowed.

10
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,240
No sadness, fear, or pain.

11
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,440
If you show even a little bit,

12
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:41,970
it will trigger the system,

13
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,960
and monsters will purge you into an NPC
that only knows how to smile.

14
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:44,880
From now on,

15
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,680
Qiqi and Chubby, you two stay together

16
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,040
and monitor each other's emotions.

17
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:51,100
Xiaofei, you're in charge of
recording all anomalies.

18
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:53,880
We must find the server terminal
of this world.

19
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,000
Han,

20
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,040
what about Yang?

21
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,280
Why isn't he here?

22
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:00,820
Don't contact him for now.

23
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,440
Why? Isn't Yang one of us?

24
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:05,640
He's too adapted to this perfect world.

25
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,840
Until we find out if he's controlled
by the system,

26
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,930
he's an extremely dangerous
potential risk.

27
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,440
Why are you here in the middle
of the night?

28
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,200
I can't sleep alone.

29
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,000
Whenever I close my eyes,

30
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,840
all I see are the monsters and blood
from the instances.

31
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,300
Can I stay here for a while?

32
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:38,440
Come in. You can rest here.

33
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:40,240
I'll go heat up some milk for you.

34
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:46,920
Warning.

35
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:48,160
Illegal access.

36
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,240
Core data offline.

37
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,200
Cleaners dispatched.

38
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,400
Mr. Liu Yiyang,

39
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:49,120
in the past four instances,

40
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,440
your combat data,

41
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,440
emotional data, and decision-making models

42
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,040
have interested me very much.

43
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,960
You have an extremely strong desire
to protect,

44
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:58,000
even a self-destructive one.

45
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,000
Cut the crap. What do you want?

46
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,120
I need someone with a strong desire
to protect

47
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:05,240
to help me maintain the operation
of the fifth instance.

48
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,440
You can become the administrator
of this new world.

49
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:08,320
In return,

50
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,520
your friends will never be hurt,

51
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,400
afraid,

52
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,260
or bleed again.

53
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,360
There are no monsters

54
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,360
and no death here.

55
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,800
What's the price?

56
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,080
The price is that

57
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:20,040
you will bear all the pain
of this world alone.

58
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,880
Whenever someone has abnormal emotions,

59
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,640
you need to act as the administrator

60
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:26,720
and cooperate with me to recycle
their pain onto yourself.

61
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,040
He's stubborn.

62
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,640
If he finds out,

63
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,080
he will never forgive me.

64
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,240
He won't find out.

65
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,320
In my world,

66
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,280
they will only have perfect happiness.

67
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:35,840
Deal.

68
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,000
As long as they can live,

69
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,640
I don't care.

70
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,360
Liu Yiyang,

71
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,880
you idiot.
